phi1] aplies the 1st order phase phi1 to the spectra. The ppm can be obtained \
using GetPpmRange and gyro with GetGyro. \\nPhaseShiftSpectra[spec, ppm, \
gyro, {phi0, phi1}] aplies the 0th and 1st order phases {phi0, phi1} to the \
spectra. The ppm can be obtained using GetPpmRange and gyro with \
GetGyro.\\n\\nThe 0th order phase phi0 is in radians and the 1st order phase \
phi1 is in ms.\"\>", "InformationUsageText",
