with voxels dimensions vox.\nFiberTractography[tensor, vox, {par, {min, \
max}}] performs fibertractography on the tensor with voxels dimensions vox \
with additional stoppin criteria\npar, where tracts are only generated \
between values of par min and max.\nFiberTractography[tensor, vox, {{par, \
{min, max}}, ..}] performs fibertractography on the tensor with voxels \
dimensions vox with \nmultiple additional stopping criteria\n", 
